notes=('Digital audio workstation: 100-plus old names reduced to 11 archetypes (Pro Tools, Logic Pro, Cubase, Live, FL Studio, Studio One, Reaper, Bitwig, GarageBand, Reason, Digital Performer) plus 16 flat; dropped dead or museum trackers and sequencers (FastTracker 2, Impulse Tracker, NoiseTracker, ScreamTracker, SoundTracker, ProTracker, OctaMED, Ultimate Soundtracker, Cubasic, Jam Session, KeyKit, HighC, Z-Maestro, Kristal, Soundscape, AudioDesk, Ensoniq PARIS, DirectMusic Producer, Record, Orion Studio) and trade systems (Pyramix, Fairlight, Vegas Pro duplicate). '
 'Notation: k77 had no models; archetypes Sibelius, Dorico, Finale (discontinued August 2024, confirmed), MuseScore, LilyPond, Notion, plus flat from the list page. Guitar tablature and Music-learning app are new kinds. Audio editor 21 to 3 archetypes plus 8 (dropped Soundbooth, BIAS Peak, Jokosher, Sweep, Audiotool, NU-Tech, WaveSurfer, Ecasound, RiffWorks, Diamond Cut). DJ software 9 to 5 archetypes plus 5. Singing synthesisers: Vocaloid engine versions, Hatsune Miku voicebank versions, UTAU, Synthesizer V, CeVIO. Show control trimmed from 45 to QLab plus 10 (dropped Medialon, Pandoras Box, Smode, CSC, Kommander, Revelik and other trade or dead systems). Melodics sourced from the title of a retrieved comparison page only; the page body was empty. Maker for Studio One and Reaper taken from old data/comparison.')
